{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50299","headline":"秋中霖雨 · 佚名","name":"秋中霖雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒雨霖霖竟不停，覊愁寂寂夜何宁？\n山遥塞阔阻乡国，草白风悲感客情。\n西瞻瀚海肠堪断，东望咸秦思转盈。\n才薄孰知无所用，独嗟戎俗滞微名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}